{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>The first of all that is in their land.</b> The first of all the fruit of the ground." "And the sense of <b>all that is clean in your house shall eat it.</b> To warn concerning those fats [portions], for all that is clean in your house shall eat it: the breast of the wave offering and the thigh of the terumah, and what the Israelite consecrates — he shall not eat it, for it is for HaShem, and you shall eat it."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {1 "The word חלבים literally means 'fats'; the passage enumerates priestly portions, but the referent of חלבים and the logic of the list are compressed and textually difficult."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:20.440606324Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}